  ("Following normal mathematical convention, exponentiation has higher pri-" 0.2208 0.8121 0.3693 0.3810 0.3810 0.0117 0.00534 0.3032 0.0757 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 7)
  ("ority than multiplication and division, which in turn have higher priority than" 0.1924 0.8119 0.3854 0.3971 0.3971 0.0117 0.00534 0.2930 0.0375 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 11)
  ("addition and subtraction. For example, 2∗3↑4 means 2∗(3↑4), while 2+3∗4" 0.1924 0.8119 0.4002 0.4132 0.4132 0.0117 0.00534 0.3115 0.0661 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 9)
  ("means 2+ (3∗4). Moreover, exponentiation associates (brackets) to the right," 0.1924 0.8116 0.4163 0.4293 0.4293 0.0117 0.00578 0.2840 0.0500 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 9)
