  ("rather than relying on the above conventions." 0.1924 0.5576 0.4819 0.4936 0.4936 0.0117 0.00633 0.1974 0.0490 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 6)
  ("In addition to functions on integers, the library file also provides a range" 0.2208 0.8120 0.4983 0.5100 0.5100 0.0117 0.00676 0.2472 0.0169 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 12)
