  ("In practice, when an error occurs the Hugs system also produces a message" 0.1924 0.8116 0.7843 0.7960 0.7960 0.0117 0.00736 0.2281 0.0169 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 12)
  ("that provides some information about the likely cause, but these messages are" 0.1924 0.8117 0.8004 0.8121 0.8121 0.0117 0.00555 0.2832 0.0336 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 11)
  ("often rather technical, and are not discussed further in this book." 0.1924 0.7179 0.8165 0.8282 0.8282 0.0117 0.00615 0.2209 0.0401 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 10)
  ("For reference, appendix A presents some of the most commonly used defi-" 0.2208 0.8118 0.8329 0.8446 0.8446 0.0117 0.00589 0.3138 0.0266 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 11)
