  ("Note that parentheses are still required in the Haskell expression f (g x)" 0.1924 0.8118 0.5915 0.6032 0.6032 0.0117 0.00921 0.2298 0.0380 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 12)
