  ("As well as the functions provided in the standard prelude, it is also possible to" 0.1924 0.8118 0.7255 0.7372 0.7372 0.0117 0.00527 0.2829 0.0209 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 14)
  ("define new functions. New functions cannot be defined at the > prompt within" 0.1924 0.8119 0.7416 0.7533 0.7533 0.0117 0.00457 0.3598 0.0471 "KMLOPE+CMR10" 0.0130 nil nil 12)
